values ('c9e0f1a2-3b4c-4d79-8e89-9f0a1b2c3d49', 'psychological-testing-and-assessment', 'Psychological Testing and Assessment', 'Psychological Testing and Assessment introduces the science and practice of psychological measurement. Students learn reliability, validity, test construction, norms, standard scores, fairness, ethics, and applied assessment across cognitive, achievement, personality, clinical, behavioral, neuropsychological, and educational contexts. The course covers psychometrics and applied assessment material to provide a comprehensive syllabus.');

