sment often works through teams and systems."}]}, {"id": "e211c8d1-ebc7-46c4-8db7-bd5027112b38", "type": "topic", "title": "Assessment Critique and Test Development Capstone", "description": "Students demonstrate mastery by evaluating an existing instrument or developing a defensible mini-assessment plan.", "children": [{"id": "941b8f06-fd79-4db3-ad9f-b245bfb6fe0c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Test critique", "children": [{"id": "601fa65a-2b57-41c0-9eda-2844d1e83c94", "type": "concept", "title": "Construct, intended use, norms, reliability, validity, fairness, and usability"}, {"id": "542a0dff-0716-4a66-bd42-0bf4431ffb1d", "type": "concept", "title": "Manual review and independent test reviews"}, {"id": "130799ea-442c-471a-a34d-cdfac7cd51c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Appropriate and inappropriate use cases"}], "description": "Students demonstrate they can evaluate a real instrument before using it."}, {"id": "3f07bd70-37ad-4047-abb1-6509074ad055", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Mini-measure development", "children": [{"id": "6c939c4e-f581-4bf4-8260-edd3675a4696", "type": "concept", "title": "Construct definition and blueprint"}, {"id": "4975f19a-d790-48a1-8025-f213b3b97803", "type": "concept", "title": "Item writing, pilot plan, reliability/validity plan"}, {"id": "2f0ff3a7-f708-4c42-8c2b-60c2afa93988", "type": "concept", "title": "Fairness, accessibility, and documentation"}], "description": "Students practice building a small defensible measure."}, {"id": "ca4f5f2b-e625-4a56-98a5-1c88761731c5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional product", "children": [{"id": "eec657e8-0a26-4816-9632-a1a3cd2e87c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Test review memo, assessment battery plan, or prototype scale"}, {"id": "dad51c27-dd7c-4585-b3b2-603bd2eb6c3b", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethics and limitations section"}, {"id": "f8c617b2-137a-4710-8345-1c78e449fdfd", "type": "concept", "title": "Brief presentation with recommendations"}], "description": "The capstone turns a